<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The script measures the line height and the full height, re-measures when the text's box changes size or the fonts load, and animates between the two heights. A full expansion takes <code>--expand-base</code> (200ms); reversing part-way takes a share of it. With reduced motion it switches at once. Without script the whole text shows.</p></div>

